        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.439,
            0.847,
            0.483
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "? Is an "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "m \\times n"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " grid tileable with 2 × 1 tiles, if one of m and n is even and the other is odd? If yes, come up with a general strategy to tile it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
